confidence: 75
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "Every persisted gate verdict is replayable and queryable after CI logs expire, with the judged revision, assertion evidence, compute cost, and detected provenance."
actual_result: Assurance runs append verified workspace-history records and bounded fresh-process queries recover their structured evidence; dry runs leave no record.
